---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<!-- 404：Cloudflare Pages 找不到路徑時會自動回傳這一頁。不被索引，不輸出 canonical／hreflang。 -->
<Base
  lang="zh-TW"
  title="找不到頁面｜Page not found｜步步看懂 Step Through"
  description="找不到這一頁。Page not found."
  noindex
>
  <main class="mx-auto flex min-h-[70vh] max-w-[720px] flex-col justify-center px-4 py-20">
    <div
      class="relative border border-hairline px-6 py-10"
      style="background-image: radial-gradient(var(--color-hairline) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 16px 16px;"
    >
      <span class="reg tl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="reg tr" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="reg bl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="reg br" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="font-mono text-[28px] font-medium tabular-nums">404</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-[36px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-[44px]">找不到這一頁</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[22px]" lang="en">Page not found</p>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-[34em] text-[15px] leading-[1.7]">
        網址可能打錯了，或這個主題還沒推出。從首頁的主題目錄找找看。
        <span lang="en" class="block">The address may be mistyped, or the topic is not available yet. Try the topic index on the home page.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3">
        <a href="/zh-TW/" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center border border-ink bg-ink px-5 text-[15px] text-paper">回到首頁</a>
        <a href="/en/" lang="en" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center text-[15px] underline underline-offset-4">Back to home →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .reg {
    position: absolute;
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(var(--color-ink), var(--color-ink)) center / 100% 1px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(var(--color-ink), var(--color-ink)) center / 1px 100% no-repeat;
  }
  .tl { top: 4px; left: 4px; }
  .tr { top: 4px; right: 4px; }
  .bl { bottom: 4px; left: 4px; }
  .br { bottom: 4px; right: 4px; }
</style>
